    <li>Adam, Klaus, Andrey Alexandrov, and Henning Weber, &ldquo;Inflation Distorts Relative Prices: Theory and Evidence,&rdquo; CEPR Discussion Paper DP18088, April 18, 2023. (<a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://cepr.org/publications/dp18088" target="_blank">https://cepr.org/publications/dp18088</a>)</li>
    <li>Beaudry, Paul, Thomas J. Carter, and Amartya Lahiri, &ldquo;Looking Through Supply Shocks versus Controlling Inflation Expectations: Understanding the Central Bank Dilemma,&rdquo; Bank of Canada Staff Working Paper 2022-41, October 13, 2022. (<a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.bankofcanada.ca/2022/09/staff-working-paper-2022-41/" target="_blank">https://www.bankofcanada.ca/2022/09/staff-working-paper-2022-41/</a>)</li>
    <li>Bryan, Michael F., and Christopher J. Pike, &ldquo;Median Price Changes: An Alternative Approach to Measuring Current Monetary Inflation,&rdquo; Federal Reserve Bank of Cleveland, Economic Commentary, December 1, 1991. (<a href="https://www.clevelandfed.org/publications/economic-commentary/1991/ec-19911201-median-price-changes-an-alternative-approach-to-measuring-current-monetary-inflation">https://doi.org/10.26509/frbc-ec-19911201</a>)</li>
