    <li>Lucas, Robert E., Jr., &ldquo;Expectations and the Neutrality of Money,&rdquo; Journal of Economic Theory 4, 1972, pp. 103-124. (<a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://doi.org/10.1016/0022-0531(72)90142-1" target="_blank">https://doi.org/10.1016/0022-0531(72)90142-1</a>)</li>
